sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Quan tri vien (Admin)
    participant RecCtrl as AdminReconciliationController
    participant RecSvc as AdminReconciliationService
    participant Helpers as ServicePackageHelpers
    participant Cache as SubscriptionEntitlementService
    participant Audit as AuditLogService
    participant Pii as PiiMaskingHelper & TabularExport
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (EF Core)

    Note over Admin,DB: A-11 Giam sat so cai VietQR, doi soat thu cong & Xuat bang ke an danh PII

    Admin->>RecCtrl: GET /api/v1/admin/reconciliations/ledger?onlyAnomalies=true
    RecCtrl->>RecSvc: GetPaymentLedgerAsync(query)
    RecSvc->>DB: Load ServiceOrders + Orphan PaymentWebhookLogs (MatchedOrderId == null)
    RecSvc->>RecSvc: Hop nhat ban ghi, loc trang thai & tinh KPI Summary (MatchedRevenue, OpenAnomalies, Discrepancy)
    RecCtrl-->>Admin: 200 OK (summary + items)

    Admin->>RecCtrl: PATCH /api/v1/admin/reconciliations/orders/{orderOrWhCode}/resolve
    RecCtrl->>RecSvc: ResolvePaymentAnomalyAsync(adminId, orderOrWhCode, request)
    RecSvc->>DB: Kiem tra ma don ECO... hoac webhook mo coi WH-...
    alt Da Resolved hoac Refunded truoc do
        RecSvc-->>RecCtrl: ConflictException (BR-PAY-06 / MSG-PAY-08)
        RecCtrl-->>Admin: 409 Conflict
    else Cho phep xu ly (ApproveAndActivate / ManualMatchOrder / MarkRefunded / MarkExcessRefunded / CloseAnomaly)
        RecSvc->>DB: BeginTransactionAsync()
        alt ApproveAndActivate hoac ManualMatchOrder
            RecSvc->>DB: Cap nhat Order = Paid, Reconciliation = Resolved, MatchedOrderId
            RecSvc->>Helpers: ActivateSubscriptionForOrderAsync(db, targetOrder, utcNow)
            RecSvc->>Cache: InvalidateUserEntitlements(targetOrder.UserId)
        else MarkRefunded, MarkExcessRefunded hoac CloseAnomaly
            RecSvc->>DB: Cap nhat Order/OrphanLog = Refunded hoac Resolved + ResolutionBankRef
        end
        RecSvc->>Audit: LogAsync(RESOLVE_PAYMENT_ANOMALY)
        RecSvc->>DB: CommitTransactionAsync()
        RecCtrl-->>Admin: 200 OK (MSG-PAY-08, ReconciliationLedgerItemDto)
    end

    Admin->>RecCtrl: GET /api/v1/admin/reconciliations/export?format=csv
    RecCtrl->>RecSvc: ExportReconciliationReportAsync(adminId, query)
    RecSvc->>DB: Load Unified Records theo bo loc ngay & trang thai
    RecSvc->>Pii: MaskEmail(payerEmail) & MaskPhone(payerPhone) (BR-ADM-06)
    RecSvc->>Pii: BuildUtf8BomCsv() hoac BuildMinimalOpenXmlWorkbook()
    RecSvc->>Audit: LogAsync(EXPORT_RECONCILIATION)
    RecCtrl-->>Admin: 200 OK FileStream + Header X-EcoLink-Message-Code: MSG-ADM-02
